      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GANGSTER GORT (2) turned in a plain performance last time when sixth at Maitland over 450m behind Canya Scandal (25.76) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and is a key runner. DAKILA (5) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing seventh (30.94) last time in a Grade 5 at Gosford. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Likely to be thereabouts. INDIGO PEARL (1) showed good speed off a low draw but weakened and run over late when 6th over 600m at this track in Mix company. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. HOT TO RULE (3) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
